tendrás dos martes de tacos.

157
00:09:37,620 --> 00:09:39,120
Solo que uno será los miércoles.

158
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,620
-Doble de diver.
-El doble.

159
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:42,700
¡El doble de tacos!

160
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:45,170
